      "detail": "PASS\nCoherent literature-review thesis on digital marketing/social media and customer loyalty in Italian SMEs. Strong methodological self-awareness: consistently and honestly flags transferability limits, absence of primary data, and gaps in SME-specific evidence. Citations are integrated and match the bibliography. Minor issues: some source titles show garbled characters (Bann?, MORETTI & TUAN dated 2014 in DOI but cited 2018, Benelli 2026 future-dated and used loosely), and a truncated sentence in the Kerse quote ('mediating role  CC fit's effect'). Repetitive limit-disclaimers across chapters, but structurally sound, well-argued, and academically acceptable.",
